WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.145 --> 00:00:04.667
Just hope and he will show you.

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:07.970
You can't look over the mountain.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:09.350
Don't look over it.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.313
Don't look over it.

00:00:11.314 --> 00:00:15.737
About our attitude to this animal, we have
one saying that sounds like this.

00:00:15.738 --> 00:00:21.542
In the morning I get up, I see my father,
then the horse, and then my wife and

00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:21.603
children.

00:00:21.603 --> 00:00:23.504
The horse stands so high.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.528
For Turkmenistan?

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.229
For Turkmenistan.

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:30.669
It's very expensive.

00:00:30.669 --> 00:00:31.849
The average price is 100,000 dollars.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:38.754
There are thought to be fewer than 5,000
Akhol techies in the world, but the

00:00:38.754 --> 00:00:40.754
president himself is said to own a herd of
seven.

00:00:40.754 --> 00:00:42.754
several hundred.

00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:45.317
For the President, the halteke is
something very important as a symbol for

00:00:45.317 --> 00:00:47.317
the nation.

00:00:47.317 --> 00:00:49.317
That's true?

00:00:49.317 --> 00:00:51.317
Yes, yes.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.317
We always wear it on our horses.

00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:55.317
We have a big love for horses.

00:00:55.317 --> 00:00:57.317
Thank you.

00:00:57.317 --> 00:01:00.042
Wearing the traditional costume, a jacket
and hat made from sheep's wool, the

00:01:00.042 --> 00:01:02.042
papaka, a symbol of honour and dignity.

00:01:02.042 --> 00:01:02.443
It's really a panoply.

00:01:06.116 --> 00:01:11.140
The great leader too never misses an
opportunity to be filmed in this outfit

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:13.140
and on this animal,

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:13.923
which links him to the mythical history of
his people.

00:01:14.744 --> 00:01:17.206
He even broke another record in 2018.

00:01:17.866 --> 00:01:24.232
His own akol teki, which he had trained
himself, walked on its hind legs for 4.19

00:01:24.232 --> 00:01:26.232
seconds.

00:01:26.232 --> 00:01:27.715
A feat that is obviously listed in the
Guinness Book of Records.

00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:30.978
But his passion for horses almost cost him
dearly.

00:01:34.308 --> 00:01:38.409
In 2013, a major race was organized in
which the president took part.

00:01:39.049 --> 00:01:41.690
For once, several foreign journalists were
invited.

00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:43.811
The great leader won, of course.

00:01:45.831 --> 00:01:48.232
But at the end, in front of a large
audience,

00:01:51.993 --> 00:01:53.694
dozens of men in black rushed in.

00:01:54.254 --> 00:01:56.094
The president appeared to be unconscious.

00:01:58.075 --> 00:02:00.676
For several seconds, the regime held its
breath.

00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:03.417
He was taken to an ambulance.

00:02:03.998 --> 00:02:06.220
Later he emerged apparently well
recovered.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.323
The authorities did everything they could
to prevent the images leaking.

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:13.886
Everyone leaving the country was searched
at the airport.

00:02:14.546 --> 00:02:15.307
It was a failure.

00:02:15.828 --> 00:02:17.409
The footage went around the world.

00:02:18.189 --> 00:02:19.831
Only the Turkmens didn't see it.

00:02:20.331 --> 00:02:22.733
And it was obviously censored on national
television.

00:02:23.794 --> 00:02:26.636
The instructions were to show only the
glitz and glamour.

00:02:27.037 --> 00:02:30.440
And always, whatever happened, to praise
the dictatorship.

